error[SC0409]: this reads `p`, which another argument of the same call writes
   ╭─[ a_conflict_leaves_a_null_argument_exempt_from_the_free.c:5:22 ]
   │
 5 │     int *r = realloc(p, (p = 0, 4));
   │                      ┬   ──┬──  
   │                      ╰────────── read here
   │                            │    
   │                            ╰──── written here
